<title>FRANCE: Club Med sells stakes in Valtur, Situr.</title>
<headline>Club Med sells stakes in Valtur, Situr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Club Mediterannee said in a statement it had sold to Groupe San Paolo its 23 percent stake in Valtur and a 9.8 percent stake in Situr, both Italian tourism companies. It gave no price.</p>
<p>Valtur has annual sales of some 240 billion lire.</p>
<p>Club Med said it would continue its development in Italy, its third largest market after France and the U.S., with 85,000 clients per year.</p>
</text>
